**Karis.** A bounty hunter avenging her father's death, aided by her
GPL-issued robotic partner Arasuni. Karis is the daughter of Dromar
d'Ori, a renowned bounty hunter for the Galactic Peace Legion. When
the elusive criminal Shadowman killed her father, Karis dedicated
herself to hunting him down, eventually tracking him to an unfamiliar,
underdeveloped world: Earth. She's accompanied by Arasuni, a
GPL-issued assistant robot. Quick-witted and sharp-tongued, Karis
tends to act before she thinks. Earth's customs leave her thoroughly
out of her depth, and she has a short fuse -- especially when teased
about her appearance. *Agile +3, Attack (Boomerang) +3, Combat Expert
+1, Companion (Arasuni) +2, Cute! +1, Evasive +1, Intuitive +1,
Perceptive +1, Quick +3; Bizarre Appearance (Strange Ears) −1,
Impulsive −1, Obsession (Kill Shadowman) −3, Quirk (Stranger in a
Strange Land) −2, Sensitivity (Chest) −2, Short-Tempered −1, Soft Spot
(Stuffed Animals) −1.* Kinetic Boomerang (Armor Piercing, Ranged;
Weapon): Roll 6, DX 4, End 0. Karis's signature weapon can be wielded
versatilely, both as a blade and a boomerang. Trick Shot (Disarming,
Ranged; Ineffective, Weapon): Roll 6, DX 3, End 0. With finesse, Karis
throws her weapon in a tight arc to disarm opponents. Sweeping Strike
(Multiple Targets, Ranged; Ineffective, Weapon): Roll 6, DX 3, End 0.
Take down multiple foes in a single throw! Flex-Steel Cable
(Paralyzing x2, Ranged; Ineffective x3, Weapon): Roll 6, DX 1, End 0.
Her weapon can release a super-strong cable to entangle foes, among
other creative uses. Defense 6. Health 40, Endurance 40. TV 16.

**Companion: Arasuni.** *Armored +2, Attack +1, Combat Expert +1,
Evasive +1, Life Support +3, Strong +3, Tough +2, Unique Ability
(Computerized Brain) +1; Awkward Size (Large) −1, Bizarre Appearance
−2, Emotionless −2, Quirk (Quoting Earth) −1, Servitude (Karis) −3,
Slow −1, Vulnerability (Electricity) −2.* Iron Knuckle (Affinity:
Mighty Robot): Roll 3, DX 5, End 0. Arasuni's immense size and
strength allow him to deal a crushing blow. Stun Pulse Rifle
(Impairing, Ranged; Inaccurate, Weapon): Roll 2, DX 2, End 0. While
not the most powerful of weapons, it is useful for subduing stubborn
foes. Defense 2. Health 40, Endurance 20. TV 10.

